va Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/samarth-reva-project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹98.00 Lac - 1.40 Cr**\n\n₹27,250 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## Samarth Reva Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Samarth Reva.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  359 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 98.00 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  372 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.01 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  496 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.35 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  511 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.40 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| Retail Shop  176 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nSamarth Reva's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Samarth Reva | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 27250 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22800 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 24150 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 22600 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nSamarth Reva avg. price is ₹ 27.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-park/157970/project \"Paradigm Ananda Park\") | ₹ 31,600 |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Phase 2](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-phase-2/102126/project \"Paradigm Ananda Phase 2\") | ₹ 31,550 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 28,050 |\n| Current Project **Samarth Reva** | ₹ 27,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malad West ranges from ₹ 19.9 K to ₹ 1.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Samarth Reva | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Samarth Reva.\n\nA total of 2 residential transactions has been registered so far for Samarth Reva, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Samarth Reva ranges from ₹ 40 K to ₹ 60 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Samarth Reva moved from ₹ 22,800/sqft to ₹ 27,250/sqft, reflecting a 19.52% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 73% completion, External Works has reached 40%, Internal finishing stands at 53%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 23% done.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Samarth Reva moved from ₹ 22,600/sqft to ₹ 24,150/sqft, reflecting a 6.86% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 18% completion.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Samarth Reva From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 18.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | ₹ 2 Cr | ₹ 18,550 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Samarth Reva Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 359 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Samarth Reva, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/samarth-reva-apartment-1-bhk-359sqft-20220715160715.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 98.00 Lac\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 372 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Samarth Reva, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/samarth-reva-apartment-1-bhk-372sqft-20220715160748.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.01 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 496 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Samarth Reva, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/samarth-reva-apartment-2-bhk-496sqft-20220715160759.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.35 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 511 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Samarth Reva, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/samarth-reva-apartment-2-bhk-511sqft-20220815160814.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.40 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 176 Sq. Ft. Retail Shop in Samarth Reva, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Samarth Reva\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Samarth Reva to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Samarth Reva Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/samarth-reva-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Samarth Reva Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/samarth-reva-project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Samarth Reva\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Samarth Erectors And Developers Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs