45;crop;)\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Regalia residential project in Goregaon West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-regalia-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.59 Cr to 3.62 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Residency residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-adarsh-residency-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Samarth Reva\n\n### Is Samarth Reva a Ready to Move project?\n\nYes, Samarth Reva is a Ready to Move residential project, allowing buyers to take possession immediately without any construction wait.\n\n### What are the popular amenities available at Samarth Reva?\n\nResidents of Samarth Reva can enjoy amenities such as Gymnasium, Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Normal Park / Central Green, Indoor Games, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.\n\n### What is the locality price trend around Samarth Reva?\n\nThe average asking price in Malad West is ₹ 30,150 /Sq.Ft., while the micromarket average asking price is ₹ 35,900 /Sq.Ft..\n\n### What should I inspect in Samarth Reva after getting possession?\n\nAfter taking possession at Samarth Reva, buyers should inspect electrical fittings, plumbing and water supply (municipal/borewell), elevator operations across 1, parking allocation, common areas, and verify that the flat matches the approved Acrylic Emulsion, Vitrified Tiles, RCC Frame Structure and inventory list before moving in.\n\n### How is the connectivity from Samarth Reva?\n\nSamarth Reva enjoys excellent connectivity via New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Western Express Highway and is well connected to the Mumbai Western Suburbs area.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/samarth-reva-malad-west/29145","title":"Samarth Reva, Malad West — resale, rent & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Samarth Reva](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29145/29145-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800031028RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Samarth Reva\n\nby Samarth Erectors And Developers - Mariyamman\n\n📍 Malad West, Mumbai Suburban · 400064\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Ready project with mapped inventory**\n\nReview mapped resale, rental or ready inventory and reconfirm availability.\n\nSource stage: Ready Possession · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Samarth Reva](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29145/location.webp)![Samarth Reva](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29145/floor-plan.webp)![Samarth Reva](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/29145/furnished-homes.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nSamrath Reva is a Residential Project Developed by the Samarth Developers. It is located at Malad West. Malad West enjoys good connectivity to other parts of Mumbai. The suburb is connected to the city's suburban railway network through the Malad railway station, making it accessible to commuters. Additionally, it is well-connected to various parts of the city through a network of roads and public transportation. Walking distance from Metro Station and Link Road. The Project offers 1 and 2 BHK Modern Homes with premium internal fittings. Amenities Like Gymnasium, Grand Entrance Lobby, Rooftop Sitouts & More. The Project is nearing possession.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹27,258\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹42,500**\n\n36% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Malad West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹27,000/sqft\n\nmedian · 55 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹78.1/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹65,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.5%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹27,258/sqft** — **1% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2025\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\nShop81–300 ft²₹22 L–₹82 L\n\n1 BHK299–412 ft²₹82 L–₹1.12 Cr\n\n2 BHK496–511 ft²₹1.35 Cr–₹1.39 Cr\n\n3 BHK632 ft²₹1.72 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Samarth%20Reva%20(RERA%20P51800031028))\n\n03\n\n